{"version":1,"key":"card:725","content":{"id":725,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0d1a261a-6b33-4a86-a148-f2c752e6be54","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"投资时我们常面临一个问题：收益高的产品风险也大，那怎么判断一项投资的「性价比」？夏普比率就是用来回答这个问题的，它衡量的是每多承担一份风险，能换来多少额外收益。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3f71ba4f-11a5-42fd-9668-36b612730067","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的计算方式如下："}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\text{Sharpe Ratio} = \\frac{R_p - R_f}{\\delta_p}","collabId":"704984f8-5b98-49c3-8648-2abe6e3ca727","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"54758081-ee8b-4218-9929-c0042d5d8c7a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"eb255a7c-d192-484d-885a-2a725591aa65","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"87250874-dfee-4fc2-b6a2-4f5c7a69eb53","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"61591a3c-9e8e-40a8-9c78-9ad569ec04a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"R_f","collabId":"2f76d52e-2346-4fc6-b45c-f0989d6002c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示无风险利率，比如国债的收益率"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"90953a39-8a51-4d25-8a9